div.p:
138815. Subject: (S) instructions for US/Soviet nuclear and space arms talks.
                    Ref: (A) State 012556; (B) State 54772; (C) State 55895;
                    (D) 85 State 288127.

—Maintaining focus and priority on executing the mandate agreed at the last
                    summit to pursue areas of common ground—50 percent reduction in strategic
                    nuclear arms, appropriately applied and an interim INF agreement;

note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, D870011-0780. Secret;
                    Exdis. Drafted in the White House; cleared by Timbie, Mahley, Nosenzo, and in
                    S/S and S/S-O; approved by Adelman. Sent Immediate.
